Suggests: xdg-native-messaging-proxy
Description: pair Firefox pull request tabs with Ptyxis terminals
 Selecting a paired Ptyxis terminal selects its existing pull request tab
 without navigating Firefox or moving keyboard focus.
 .
 This package provides the Firefox native messaging host and an unsigned
 add-on for temporary loading from about:debugging. For sandboxed Firefox,
 install the optional native messaging proxy separately.
